      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm doing a report on how modern systems actually started, but honestly, everything in my textbooks feels like it's just focusing on europe and white history. it feels like it's ignoring everything else. can u help me find the actual real history of who really built the foundations of science and law, like the parts that get left out of the mainstream western narrative?",
